@startuml
title Defense Core — Accepted Single-Service Deployment View
skinparam shadowing false

node "Operator device" as ClientNode {
  artifact "Browser" as Browser
  artifact "Static UI delivered by application" as StaticUI
}

node "Application host" as AppHost {
  node "One FastAPI application process" as FastAPI {
    component "Presentation boundary" as Presentation
    component "Application + domain semantics" as Core
    component "In-memory run-scoped EventBus" as EventBus
    component "Persistence adapter" as Adapter
  }
}

database "Persistent database / storage" as Database

Browser --> StaticUI : presents
Browser --> Presentation : client-server requests
Presentation --> Core : in-process call
Core --> EventBus : in-process choreography only
Core --> Adapter : in-process persistence call
Adapter --> Database : durable definitions, runs, attempts, trace

note right of FastAPI
Single deployable application.
Orchestration and choreography run in this process.
Concrete hosting and configuration are deferred.
end note

note bottom of Database
Persistent storage is required.
Exact technology configuration, schema,
volume, and migration are deferred.
end note

note as Exclusions
Explicitly absent from the topology:
- Kafka and ZooKeeper
- distributed or external broker
- microservices or distributed execution
- external business service
- separate execution-mode services
end note

